", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974499_707742899670916_7295427879867777024_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GA3safRO5AIQ7kNvwHJGfS2&_nc_oc=AdowTd5BFcRvXu3rqJFVGYmaR_33kJUNMs_cblsyzw91PB39HpMGyOlfa0FA6EHpV_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJDD3lWNpsejSp-hMfEnOdrPv9Xtu9d2twVQfGvma5Q3w&oe=6A9D7D8B"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "654641102019922", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_413211822650152_1417785566451204096_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kZvfzEwgzxcQ7kNvwHfUoBb&_nc_oc=AdpKHGVw5aKEK6lOd0DPfWGpSXB6VM_1kmWl1RRVPs0Kjs8dOJOxxu0lZQxoClv9m8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLJx4We4VOoDgNsFzUiRxbdOVZtT4pFFuFr5YKnAIo6Mg&oe=6A9D6986"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TribeXR DJ School", "keywords": ["Education", "Learning", "DJ", "Music"], "long_description": "Hello DJ. Welcome to your VR DJ tool. \n\nTribe XR features a fully functioning pro-style CDJ mix deck. Upload your own music and refine your own unique sound.\n\nGain access to learning resources such as video tutorials, interactive tutorials and a free 1-on-1 intro class. \n\nTurn things up a notch with 1-on-1 mentor classes with professional DJ's with our new VR mentor program (beta)\n\nPerform for friends and the world with native live-streaming integrations. We'll help you set up your own VR live-mix show with real-time support. You can even request to play a live set on Tribe XR\u2019s radio show.\n\nJoin our Discord channel and have direct access to the Tribe XR team, mentors and a passionate community of music enthusiasts.\n\nPlease note: This is an early access app and we are adding new features and refinements week by week. We only support Windows 10 at this time.", "short_description": "Hello DJ. Welcome to your VR DJ tool. \n\nTribe XR features a fully functioning pro-style CDJ mi